        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-379 (ensure controlled execution — Government Registration &amp; Qualification (PA-46.1).) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: Trade Account Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
